version 0.5.45
previous 0.5.44
- On-demand apps set up faster, and Profile lets you choose how long setup holds backups: about 2, 10 or 30 minutes, or until it finishes.
- Account sync settings, such as Gmail's, stay as you left them after you sign out, and an always-on VPN keeps its Block connections choice.
- Text messages open in the app you chose for this profile; their notices say Messages and clear once you've read them.
- A sign-out that gets stuck can now be ended without saving, or the phone restarted.
- A plan bought while another is still running now shows on the Storage screen.
- Profile has an Update row with Sign out & install, and an update we mark as required says why and by when.
